 ("celtic","dagda","The Dagda","the good god of the Tuatha Dé Danann with the club, the cauldron and the harp, the Cath Maige Tuired (the porridge and the Fomorian woman, the coupling with the Morrígan at Samhain), Eochaid Ollathair, the Brú na Bóinne, the Dagda's harp Uaithne, the Sucellus comparison"),
