 ("aztec","coyolxauhqui","Coyolxauhqui","the bells-on-cheeks sister dismembered by Huitzilopochtli on Coatepec, the great stone disk found in 1978 at the foot of the Templo Mayor stairs that launched the excavations, the moon reading and its status, the sacrificed bodies rolled down the steps to land on her"),
