 ("aztec","mictlantecuhtli","Mictlantecuhtli","the lord of Mictlan with the skull face and the owl, the nine levels of the dead's journey, the bones Quetzalcoatl stole, the clay statues from the House of Eagles at the Templo Mayor, the Day of the Dead's ancestry question (the debate on continuity versus colonial creation)"),
