 ("japanese","oni","The Oni","the horned ogres with the iron clubs and tiger-skin loincloths, the demons of hell and the mountain, Shuten-dōji of Ōeyama and Minamoto no Raikō, the Setsubun bean-throwing, the Momotarō tale, the Reider study, the oni of manga as reception"),
